[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4412681807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119205#issuecomment-4412681807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119205","id":4412681807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBwQuTw","user":{"login":"nihilvm","id":282644017,"node_id":"U_kgDOENjOMQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282644017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm","html_url":"https://github.com/nihilvm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihilvm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T13:54:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T14:15:28Z","body":"Can reproduce on Windows 10. For some reason, calling `warp_mouse` a second time immediately will fix it.\n\nThe issue specifically occurs when moving the mouse and changing `mouse_mode` at the same time. Here's a similar MRP using a timer instead. (Forgive me if my usage of timers is bad; I'm rusty.)\n\n[test_mouse_drag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27552627/test_mouse_drag.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4412681807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4413722221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119205#issuecomment-4413722221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119205","id":4413722221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBxQObQ","user":{"login":"cirehildebrand","id":139603151,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFIszw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139603151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand","html_url":"https://github.com/cirehildebrand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T21:34:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T21:34:13Z","body":"THANK YOU! @nihilvm. The advice to call warp_mouse 2x has been a sufficient fix for the issue.\n\nI spent alot of time and tried many ideas, and I'm glad I can move pass this issue. I'm unsure how this fix looks at the engine level since other developers have/will run into this issue, and this game mechanic to my understanding is commonly used.\n\ncalling warp_mouse 2x in the else has been sufficient to fix.\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nvar _last_mouse_position: Vector2\n\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\n\t\tmatch event.button_index:\n\t\t\tMOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT:\n\t\t\t\tif event.pressed:\n\t\t\t\t\t_last_mouse_position = get_viewport().get_mouse_position()\n\t\t\t\t\tInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\n\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\tInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_VISIBLE\n\t\t\t\t\tget_viewport().warp_mouse(_last_mouse_position)\n\t\t\t\t\tget_viewport().warp_mouse(_last_mouse_position) # Fixes issue\n\n``` ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4413722221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4413749658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119205#issuecomment-4413749658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119205","id":4413749658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBxR5mg","user":{"login":"cirehildebrand","id":139603151,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFIszw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139603151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand","html_url":"https://github.com/cirehildebrand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cirehildebrand/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T21:49:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T21:49:56Z","body":"calling multiple warp_mouse has odd behavior for whoever can look at the engine level fix.\n\n1. 1x cause mouse warping to center bug\n2. 2x fixes warping to center but mouse still flickers in center sometimes\n3. 5x+ fixes warping to center and no visible flickering of mouse in the center\n\n1-3 can be seen in the video below.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20bcd2d7-8b20-46d4-95f2-be44bf1b6beb","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4413749658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5636252078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119205#issuecomment-5636252078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119205","id":5636252078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABT_Jhrg","user":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T14:49:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T14:49:15Z","body":"In a similar but different case, deferring the call also gives an imperfect solution which works maybe 80% of the time.\nMight be a slightly better solution than calling wrap 5 times.\n```get_viewport().call_deferred(&\"warp_mouse\", _last_mouse_position)```\n\n(It seems to work on my project, but I may have not connected the dot on weird stuff)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5636252078/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6105711026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119205#issuecomment-6105711026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119205","id":6105711026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa-3Bsg","user":{"login":"pikuler","id":46649077,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjQ5MDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46649077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler","html_url":"https://github.com/pikuler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikuler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-11T05:09:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T05:09:55Z","body":"Can repro on 